    "detailed_description": "You are a cog in a never ending war. A war that has torn the land asunder and tormented man's soul into a husk of empty nothingness. You're not special. You're just another soldier assigned to another mech to defend yet another outpost from yet another enemy. Win or lose, live or die, it has no meaning. There is only The War. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Manually aim, load, and fire your cannons at your opponent: friend, enemy, or AI!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605290/extras/433e540d534a3c4cea0bf4bf8f837ed2.poster.avif?t=1739316836\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605290/extras/433e540d534a3c4cea0bf4bf8f837ed2.webm?t=1739316836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605290/extras/433e540d534a3c4cea0bf4bf8f837ed2.mp4?t=1739316836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li> Control a steam mech and outmaneuver your opponent - escape from danger or charge straight into it!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605290/extras/2795a48f371597e202a8bd8ea0a08ea7.poster.avif?t=1739316836\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605290/extras/2795a48f371597e202a8bd8ea0a08ea7.webm?t=1739316836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605290/extras/2795a48f371597e202a8bd8ea0a08ea7.mp4?t=1739316836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li> Stay in the fight by repairing your mech with your trusty hammer!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605290/extras/10d52e62c880b56283a3d5434611209f.poster.avif?t=1739316836\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605290/extras/10d52e62c880b56283a3d5434611209f.webm?t=1739316836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605290/extras/10d52e62c880b56283a3d5434611209f.mp4?t=1739316836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li> Work as a team or play by yourself!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605290/extras/3c5d7d3e1d447f60d4a5c271c524329f.poster.avif?t=1739316836\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605290/extras/3c5d7d3e1d447f60d4a5c271c524329f.webm?t=1739316836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605290/extras/3c5d7d3e1d447f60d4a5c271c524329f.mp4?t=1739316836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></li></ul><br>VR? Check. Multiplayer? Check. Cannons? Check. Steampunk? Check. Mechs? Check. What more could you want?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605290/extras/85c4bd121a662088be9d32d4037b9e8f.poster.avif?t=1739316836\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605290/extras/85c4bd121a662088be9d32d4037b9e8f.webm?t=1739316836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605290/extras/85c4bd121a662088be9d32d4037b9e8f.mp4?t=1739316836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "You are a cog in a never ending war. A war that has torn the land asunder and tormented man's soul into a husk of empty nothingness. You're not special. You're just another soldier assigned to another mech to defend yet another outpost from yet another enemy. Win or lose, live or die, it has no meaning. There is only The War. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Manually aim, load, and fire your cannons at your opponent: friend, enemy, or AI!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605290/extras/433e540d534a3c4cea0bf4bf8f837ed2.poster.avif?t=1739316836\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605290/extras/433e540d534a3c4cea0bf4bf8f837ed2.webm?t=1739316836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605290/extras/433e540d534a3c4cea0bf4bf8f837ed2.mp4?t=1739316836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li> Control a steam mech and outmaneuver your opponent - escape from danger or charge straight into it!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605290/extras/2795a48f371597e202a8bd8ea0a08ea7.poster.avif?t=1739316836\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605290/extras/2795a48f371597e202a8bd8ea0a08ea7.webm?t=1739316836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605290/extras/2795a48f371597e202a8bd8ea0a08ea7.mp4?t=1739316836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li> Stay in the fight by repairing your mech with your trusty hammer!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605290/extras/10d52e62c880b56283a3d5434611209f.poster.avif?t=1739316836\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605290/extras/10d52e62c880b56283a3d5434611209f.webm?t=1739316836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605290/extras/10d52e62c880b56283a3d5434611209f.mp4?t=1739316836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li> Work as a team or play by yourself!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605290/extras/3c5d7d3e1d447f60d4a5c271c524329f.poster.avif?t=1739316836\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605290/extras/3c5d7d3e1d447f60d4a5c271c524329f.webm?t=1739316836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605290/extras/3c5d7d3e1d447f60d4a5c271c524329f.mp4?t=1739316836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></li></ul><br>VR? Check. Multiplayer? Check. Cannons? Check. Steampunk? Check. Mechs? Check. What more could you want?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605290/extras/85c4bd121a662088be9d32d4037b9e8f.poster.avif?t=1739316836\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605290/extras/85c4bd121a662088be9d32d4037b9e8f.webm?t=1739316836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605290/extras/85c4bd121a662088be9d32d4037b9e8f.mp4?t=1739316836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
